      "text": "Host Cluster Control Plane\n(logical role)\n\n[Kubernetes Core]\n- kube-apiserver\n- kube-scheduler\n- kube-controller-manager\n- etcd\n\n[DPF Control Layer]\n- dpf-operator-controller-manager\n- dpf-provisioning-controller-manager\n- dpuservice-controller-manager\n- kamaji-cm-controller-manager\n\n[Role]\n- stores DPF CR state\n- reconciles BFB / DPUSet / DPU / DPUCluster\n- creates and manages the DPU cluster\n- prepares BF3 to join tenant cluster",
